  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '995323c5-784e-45a4-84e7-517dcd6d1b16', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The poet vows to live their dreams:$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Only if it's easy"},{"id":"b","text":"No matter what"},{"id":"c","text":"When others approve"},{"id":"d","text":"Without any challenges"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-326Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '995323c5-784e-45a4-84e7-517dcd6d1b16', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$What does the poet refuse to do at the end of their life?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Celebrate achievements"},{"id":"b","text":"Look back at what could have been"},{"id":"c","text":"Share their experiences"},{"id":"d","text":"Reflect on successes"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-326Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '995323c5-784e-45a4-84e7-517dcd6d1b16', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The metaphor 'batter's box On the baseball field of my dreams' represents:$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"A literal sports arena"},{"id":"b","text":"A place of comfort and safety"},{"id":"c","text":"The arena where one faces life's challenges and pursues aspirations"},{"id":"d","text":"A spectator's viewpoint"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-326Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '995323c5-784e-45a4-84e7-517dcd6d1b16', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$One of the listed learning outcomes after reading the poem is to use prepositions:$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Creatively in poems"},{"id":"b","text":"Correctly in sentences"},{"id":"c","text":"Only in formal writing"},{"id":"d","text":"To express emotions"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-326Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '995323c5-784e-45a4-84e7-517dcd6d1b16', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The unit containing 'Bravery Pledge' is titled:$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Courageous Acts"},{"id":"b","text":"Facing Challenges"},{"id":"c","text":"Sensitivity Towards All"},{"id":"d","text":"Poetic Expressions"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-326Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '995323c5-784e-45a4-84e7-517dcd6d1b16', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The poem encourages readers to make choices and follow their:$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Friends' advice"},{"id":"b","text":"Parents' expectations"},{"id":"c","text":"True desires"},{"id":"d","text":"Societal norms"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-326Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '995323c5-784e-45a4-84e7-517dcd6d1b16', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$What does the phrase 'stand up and be counted' imply in the poem?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"To be physically present"},{"id":"b","text":"To take a stand and be recognized for one's convictions"},{"id":"c","text":"To count votes in an election"},{"id":"d","text":"To avoid confrontation"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-326Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
