  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '995323c5-784e-45a4-84e7-517dcd6d1b16', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The poet will proudly state their identity and aspirations before:$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Only themselves"},{"id":"b","text":"Close family members"},{"id":"c","text":"God and all who see"},{"id":"d","text":"A select few"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-326Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '995323c5-784e-45a4-84e7-517dcd6d1b16', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$What is NOT a characteristic of bravery according to the poem?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Facing fears"},{"id":"b","text":"Doing what needs to be done"},{"id":"c","text":"Living without fear"},{"id":"d","text":"Making choices"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-326Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
