  ('eb1b1d64-fda3-4d50-8100-816b1a2ec5df', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '995323c5-784e-45a4-84e7-517dcd6d1b16', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$A group of friends is planning a challenging outdoor activity, and one friend, Sarah, is hesitant due to past negative experiences. She remembers the poet's vow to 'live my dreams no matter what.'$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-326Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('59e2f0be-7221-471b-a209-b118c57c4c6a', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '995323c5-784e-45a4-84e7-517dcd6d1b16', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$A student, Tom, is considering pursuing a non-traditional career path that his family is skeptical about. He reflects on the poet's declaration: 'This is who I am and what I want to be.'$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-326Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 2, NULL),
  ('c7fd3109-6e3c-4771-a4d8-f133015e9516', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '995323c5-784e-45a4-84e7-517dcd6d1b16', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$A young entrepreneur, Maya, launched her startup with immense passion and hard work. Despite facing numerous rejections from investors and experiencing initial product failures, she refused to 'cower' or feel 'ashamed.' She often told her team, 'We will go down swinging if we have to, but we won't give up without giving our absolute best.' Her determination was evident in every setback she encountered, always searching for the strength to be brave and innovate further.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-326Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('a533ca6d-7f52-4dc7-b7df-9a756cfae36e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '995323c5-784e-45a4-84e7-517dcd6d1b16', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Liam, a dedicated athlete, trained relentlessly for years, dreaming of winning a national championship. He faced intense competition and moments where he felt on the verge of 'striking out' from exhaustion or self-doubt. Yet, the thought that his failure would not be for 'lack of courage or effort' propelled him forward. He believed that if his success was 'meant to be,' he would eventually 'hit a home run,' but only after giving everything he had.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-326Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('ad5cc2b9-66eb-46f8-851a-c9e35f99d495', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '995323c5-784e-45a4-84e7-517dcd6d1b16', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Dr. Anya Sharma dedicated her career to finding a cure for a rare disease. Years of research yielded no breakthroughs, and many colleagues suggested she pivot to a less challenging field. However, Dr. Sharma possessed an unwavering 'I will' spirit. She knew that if she did not achieve her ultimate goal, it would not be for lack of trying. She continued her work, driven by the hope that one day, her efforts would culminate in a 'home run' for humanity, a success that many were 'destined to witness'.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-326Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('9fd150ab-8c8f-4737-8905-2d59d15dc7cb', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '995323c5-784e-45a4-84e7-517dcd6d1b16', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$A community leader, Mr. Chen, tirelessly advocated for a new public park. He encountered bureaucratic hurdles, public skepticism, and funding challenges. Despite these obstacles, he never allowed himself to be 'affected by' the negativity. He maintained a 'blissful' determination, finding satisfaction in every small step forward. His resolve echoed in the community meetings, inspiring others to join his cause.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-326Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('44a9a120-d4bc-47f2-8614-bd6311b9b5f5', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '995323c5-784e-45a4-84e7-517dcd6d1b16', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$A student, Rohan, struggled with a particularly difficult subject. He often felt like giving up, but his teacher encouraged him to adopt the poet's mindset: 'Or feel ashamed if I should strike out. That will not only echo in my heart and mind, It will not be for lack of courage or effort.' Rohan decided to approach his studies with renewed vigor, understanding that true failure was not in getting a low grade, but in not trying his absolute best.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-326Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
